          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Terms & Conditions",
            "answer": "<h3></h3><p><strong>Eligibility and Enrollment</strong><br/>Milano Diamond Circle is available to all ShopMilano.com customers in the United States. Participation requires no initial purchase; however, rewards earned through the program may only be used on future purchases. To join, customers must create an account at <a>www.shopmilano.com/register</a>. Enrollment can occur during checkout or through the account creation page. Customers with existing accounts are automatically enrolled. Signing up for the Milano Diamond Circle does not require email or SMS subscription, but opting out of these communications may limit updates about eligible rewards and special offers. Customers who prefer not to participate can use the \"checkout as guest\" feature.</p><p><strong>Earning Milano Cash Rewards</strong><br/>ShopMilano.com may award Milano Cash for customer activities such as engaging on social media, referring friends, submitting product reviews, or other eligible actions specified by ShopMilano.com. Details on earning opportunities and rewards will be provided on the <strong>Milano Diamond Circle page</strong> at <a>www.shopmilano.com/milano-diamond-circle</a>.</p><p><strong>Program Modifications</strong><br/>ShopMilano.com reserves the right to amend or cancel the Milano Diamond Circle program at its discretion. Members found violating program terms may be removed.</p><p><strong>Eligibility Restrictions</strong><br/>The program is open to customers with U.S. shipping addresses only. International customers are currently ineligible.</p><h3>Milano Diamond Circle Benefits</h3><p>Members are rewarded Milano Cash to use on future ShopMilano.com purchases. Additional benefits may be introduced and communicated to eligible members. The earning rates and reward amounts are determined by ShopMilano.com and are subject to change. Rewards are valid for 1 year from the issue date.</p><p><strong>Milano Cash Terms and Conditions</strong></p><ul><li>Milano Cash discounts apply to the merchandise subtotal after applicable discounts but before tax, shipping, or handling charges.</li><li>Milano Cash cannot cover shipping, handling, or taxes and may not be retroactively applied to past purchases.</li><li>Members must log in to their accounts to redeem Milano Cash at checkout. Unused rewards cannot be applied post-checkout.</li><li>Milano Cash has no cash value and can only be used as discounts on new jewelry purchases from ShopMilano.com.</li></ul><p>Returns made using Milano Cash will result in the refund of the original payment method, with the used Milano Cash reinstated and the earned Milano Cash deducted.</p><p><strong>Exclusions</strong><br/>Milano Cash can only be redeemed on jewelry and loose diamond purchases. It cannot be applied to warranties, taxes, shipping, or other fees. Some coupon codes may be ineligible for use with Milano Cash and will be indicated during checkout.</p>"
          }
        }
